The Lojban WWW Server at

 <a href="http://xiron.pc.helsinki.fi/lojban/">The Lojban Archive</a>

has now a searchable gismu list which produces formatted extracts
from the full list. The search engine ( glimpse / agrep ) allows
regular expressions, AND/OR combinations of words and a limited
number of typing errors. I'll be adding more searchable material
shortly.

There have been 875 visitors (client addresses) until now.
There are already several permanent references to the server at
various locations on the Web so a steady trickle of new visitors
is to be expected.

